Description: Goodix 27c6:533c reader (Dell XPS 13 9300 and 9310)
 The goodix53x5 driver from seaweeduk/goodix53x5-libfprint pull request
 334, commit 52584a593d29e1cf8b317f53cb46c54396a3e4f1 (LGPL-2.1-or-later),
 with only its 533c (GM168SEC) family. Wild OS changes: the 5335/5385/5395
 family, which writes a PSK to the sensor, is left out with the PSK write
 command; the 533c family sends only an allow-list of read and RAM-only
 commands; firmware in its bootloader is refused; the update-result calls
 use stock libfprint 1.94.9 API; CRC-32 is computed locally instead of with
 libdeflate; three matcher guards (a loop bound, INT64_MIN / -1, zeroed
 results) and a divide-by-zero guard. 533c moves from the unsupported list
 to the driver's hwdb section. The driver's matcher unit tests are added.
Origin: https://github.com/seaweeduk/goodix53x5-libfprint/pull/334
Forwarded: not-needed
---
